<article class="ltx_document ltx_fleqn">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Knowledge Graph-Guided Multi-Agent Distillation for Reliable Industrial Question Answering with Datasets</h1>
<span class="ltx_pubnotes ltx_pubnotes_meta"><span class="ltx_pubnotes_content"><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_journal"><span class="ltx_note_name">Journal: </span>Information Systems</span></span></span>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Jiqun Pan
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
